<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#111111">
<title>🔒 Mi secreto</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html, body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        font-family: "Courier New", monospace;

        background: linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #ff006e,
            #8338ec,
            #3a86ff,
            #06d6a0,
            #ffbe0b,
            #fb5607
        );
        background-size: 500% 500%;
        animation: colores 9s ease infinite;
    }

    @keyframes colores {
        0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }
        100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    .pantalla {
        width: min(900px, 94vw);
        padding: clamp(25px, 6vw, 55px) clamp(18px, 5vw, 45px);
        text-align: center;
        background: #111;
        border: 7px solid #fff;
        box-shadow:
            12px 12px 0 #000,
            0 0 35px rgba(255,255,255,.45);
        color: white;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
    }

    .titulo {
        margin: 0 0 30px;
        color: #00ff66;
        font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 20px);
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #064;
    }

    h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(21px, 5vw, 43px);
        line-height: 1.45;
        text-shadow:
            4px 4px 0 #ff006e,
            8px 8px 0 #8338ec;
        animation: parpadeo 1.6s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes parpadeo {
        from { opacity: 1; }
        to { opacity: .82; }
    }

    .papas {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 13px 20px;
        color: #111;
        background: #ffbe0b;
        border: 5px solid white;
        box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #ff006e;
        font-size: clamp(17px, 4vw, 24px);
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .scanlines {
        pointer-events: none;
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 5;
        background: repeating-linear-gradient(
            0deg,
            rgba(255,255,255,.035) 0px,
            rgba(255,255,255,.035) 2px,
            transparent 2px,
            transparent 5px
        );
    }

    .pixel {
        position: fixed;
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        background: white;
        opacity: .65;
        animation: flotar 4s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    .p1 { top: 10%; left: 8%; }
    .p2 { top: 75%; left: 12%; animation-delay: 1s; }
    .p3 { top: 18%; right: 10%; animation-delay: 2s; }
    .p4 { bottom: 10%; right: 8%; animation-delay: 3s; }

    @keyframes flotar {
        0%,100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(90deg); }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="pixel p1"></div>
<div class="pixel p2"></div>
<div class="pixel p3"></div>
<div class="pixel p4"></div>

<main class="pantalla">
    <div class="titulo">★ SECRET MESSAGE ★</div>

    <h1>
        Cómo lograste entrar a mi secreto<br>
        bueno mi secreto es que me gustan<br>
        las papas con queso 👍
    </h1>

    <div class="papas">🥔 + 🧀 = ❤️</div>
</main>

<div class="scanlines"></div>

</body>
</html>
